# This repo is edited on Windows where core.autocrlf rewrites line endings, but
# these files are read by bash and systemd on the Raspberry Pi. A stray CR makes
# a script fail with "$'\r': command not found", so pin them to LF even in the
# Windows working tree — that way copying the folder to the Pi works too.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
